neo-code (0.7.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Chơi mode drives real hardware out of the box: thingbot-telemetrix is
    now a dependency, and since apt cannot resolve a PyPI package, the
    build installs it into the package with pip --target. A single .deb is
    still all there is to install. A copy already installed on the system
    takes precedence. Without a board attached the simulated arm still
    takes over as before.

 -- ThingEdu <everwellmax@gmail.com>  Thu, 23 Jul 2026 15:20:00 +0700

neo-code (0.7.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Chơi (Play) mode: a third mode where kids drive a 3-joint ThingBot arm
    from Python — a free-exploration sandbox with no goal or grading. The
    side panel is a tappable API reference; the right column shows live
    joint telemetry above the result console. Works from both the editor
    and the REPL, and falls back to a simulated arm with no board attached.
  * Result console: the three near-identical output panels are now one
    shared components/common/ResultConsole.qml.
  * Depend on python3-serial (arm serial link).

 -- ThingEdu <everwellmax@gmail.com>  Thu, 23 Jul 2026 14:20:00 +0700

neo-code (0.6.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Console: prompts for and forwards typed answers to a running program's
    input() calls, via a new shared ConsoleView used by both the terminal
    and Học-mode result console.
  * Học mode: toolbar now has New/Open/Save like Sáng tạo, and the result
    console has a clear button.

 -- ThingEdu <everwellmax@gmail.com>  Tue, 21 Jul 2026 17:41:00 +0700

neo-code (0.6.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * App icon: chevron mark on a ThingEdu-green tile, installed into the hicolor
    theme (16-512 + scalable) so the .desktop entry resolves an icon at last.
  * AppButton: icon-only buttons size square, utility variant adapts to light
    or dark hosts, checkable toggles, tooltips, M3 pressed/focus states.
  * Học mode: 4 new curriculum topics with 12 lessons.
  * Console output wraps; scrollback capped at 1000 lines.

 -- ThingEdu <everwellmax@gmail.com>  Tue, 21 Jul 2026 17:30:00 +0700

neo-code (0.5.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * PyQt6 + QML UI (editor, run/stop, REPL, lessons with grading, robot,
    settings) via thin QObject controllers over the event bus.
  * Friendly Light design system (Neo Play branding): Nunito + JetBrains Mono
    fonts, Material Design Icons, integrated light consoles.
  * Remove the in-app updater; updates go through scripts/install_on_neo.sh.

 -- ThingEdu <everwellmax@gmail.com>  Tue, 21 Jul 2026 01:50:00 +0700

neo-code (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Migrate from PyQt5 (QWidgets) to PyQt6 + QML.
  * Initial Debian packaging. Architecture-independent package; PyQt6 and
    the Qt6 QML runtime are pulled from apt (never built via pip), matching
    the ARM install strategy of scripts/install_on_neo.sh.
  * Drop unused Jedi / pyflakes / thingbot-telemetrix dependencies.

 -- ThingEdu <everwellmax@gmail.com>  Mon, 20 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0700
